    {
      "SourceElementId": "G11-U04-L15-ACTIVITY-009",
      "SourceSection": "15.2: Retire A Millionaire?",
      "SourceExcerpt": "Suppose you opened this account at the beginning of this year. Assume that you deposit no additional money and withdraw nothing from the account. Will the account balance reach $1,000,000 and make you a millionaire by the time you reach…",
